a11y(web): audit the toolkit, later wizard steps and answered drills; toolkit buttons named by their text

- The axe audit now also covers:
  - the sandbox Toolkit;
  - a new sandbox game with both armies chosen;
  - the new-list wizard's detachment and army-options steps;
  - lesson 2's drill after answering;
  - the table setup's armies step.
- The Toolkit's tool buttons were named only by the tool, not by their visible text (WCAG 2.5.3). They are now named
  by the tool and its description.

Found by the whole-branch review.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

